    "html": "<p>Two resistors of equal resistance R are connected with two cells of emf ε and 2ε. Both cells have negligible internal resistance.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the current in the resistor labelled X?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{ε}{2R}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3ε}{2R}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{ε}{R}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3ε}{R}\"></span></li></ol>"
